135
00:09:46.961 --> 00:09:49.088
-Gusto ko ng ginseng chicken soup.
-Isang magandang mangkok ng palayok na bigas.

136
00:09:49.171 --> 00:09:51.924
Gusto ko yata ng pork belly
at nilagang kimchi.

137
00:09:52.008 --> 00:09:54.719
-Tignan mo yung nilagang kimchi at baboy!
-Mukhang maganda yan.

138
00:09:54.802 --> 00:09:56.053
Mayroon silang sabaw ng pinakuluang manok!

139
00:09:56.554 --> 00:09:57.722
Mukhang maganda yan.

140
00:10:02.643 --> 00:10:04.687
Tignan mo yan. Naghanda sila ng pot rice.

141
